WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.600
GossipSub v1.1 · run live · broken on purpose

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:09.000
50 peers · one publish · every hop drawn

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.400
Five Sybils graft in and flood

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.400
Pruned by score · two heartbeats · nobody coordinated it

